    M11 unknown-session refusal returns nothing     → a_session_the_host_no_longer_holds_is_refused_before_anything_is_read
    M12 no-adapter refusal relabelled as nothing    → a_host_without_a_git_adapter_refuses_rather_than_inventing_wording
